{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZypTAn4WO41795476805.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>一架的士在尖東，懷疑輾傷兩名女子後駛離，傷者清醒送院。</p><p></p><p>兩名女子腳傷要送院治理。現場消息稱，凌晨近四時，兩名女子在康達徑打算搭的士，截停涉事的士後，司機懷疑拒載，並將車駛離期間輾傷她們，事故有待警方調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T00:43:13.986059+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T23:32:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T01:17:15.739828+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T00:36:39.786754+00:00","content_hash":"439a314e801ab6c396d9d69ab1606d8485bd9220ff7ababb572d1ad91dc9501d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T00:43:13.986059+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}